DECLARE Person HAS
    age IS A NUMBER

-- The bare `age` is elaborated to `p's age` before the checker runs (R5,
-- IMPLICIT-PROPS-DESIGN §11.7). The Check phase must still emit a token at
-- it: with one AnnoHole on the synthetic projection the label was never
-- reached and the editor left the read unhighlighted.
GIVEN p IS A Person
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE adult IF age >= 18

GIVEN p IS A Person
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `adult spelled out` IF p's age >= 18
